            "line": 317,
            "text": "theorem exists_integer_frequency (C ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) :\n    ∃ N : ℕ, 0 < N ∧ ∀ n : ℕ, N ≤ n → 1 ≤ (n : ℝ) ∧ C / (n : ℝ) ≤ ε"
